		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Conical, icicle-shaped head atop a brawny milk-white torso, with four insect-like legs ending in sharp points. 8 feet tall, 15-foot leg span. Attacks during blizzards.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 40, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 claw +5 (1d8) or impaling leap, <strong>MV</strong> near (climb), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 8</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Camouflage</strong>. Hard to see, ADV to sneak and hide.</p><p></p><p><strong>Impaling Leap</strong>. Jump up to near in height and double near in distance, then make 1 claw attack. If hit, x3 damage.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
